TITLE Pyrite oxidation equilibrium, 1 kg pure water, pH 7, fixed O2(g)
SOLUTION 1
    temp 25
    pH   7 charge
    units mol/kgw
    water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    O2(g)   -0.7  10
    Pyrite   0    0.1
    Goethite 0    0
    Gypsum   0    0
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file pyrite_sel.txt
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
USER_PUNCH
    -headings SpecCond_uS_cm
10 PUNCH SC
END
